  "html": "<p>我們深感榮幸，能邀請到到享譽國際的溝通專家、中文卡內基訓練創辦人 —— 黑幼龍老師，蒞臨 EMRD 113-1 學期「技術長講座 (一)」課程，為我們帶來主題為「領導人的雙贏智慧」的精彩演講。黑老師憑藉多年來在企業管理、人際溝通等領域的豐富經驗，以及對卡內基訓練的深入研究，為無數企業和個人帶來了深厚的啟發，能邀請到黑老師蒞臨指導，是我們 EMRD 課程的一大榮幸，而黑老師的演講，也將深深地影響學員們的思維，為他們未來的領導之路打下堅實的基礎。<br> &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"533\" src=\"/legacy/img/fe10eef4af-12.jpg\" width=\"800\"></p>\n<p>大合照</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/f9ae87e2d8-01.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/3d66db61fa-02.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>會場&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 會場</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/6cd18bd6c8-03.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/85993b565f-05.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>會場&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 簽到&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/20258881dc-06.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/86c29b1f07-07.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>簽到&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;EMRD 游進陽執行長致詞</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/1d84756543-08.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/547077b41a-09.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>會場&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 工程學院 陳明志院長致詞 &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/7efc89c664-10.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/e3049dce0d-11.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>會場&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 工程學院 陳明志院長致詞 &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/561817e1a7-13.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/4484a8000d-14.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>黑幼龍老師&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;會場</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/176f843136-15.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/c910c3835d-16.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>會場&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 黑幼龍老師</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/858d47a6cd-17.jpg\" width=\"420\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"280\" src=\"/legacy/img/640c9a7dba-18.jpg\" width=\"420\"></p>\n<p>學員&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 學員&nb